## Overview

Styled Markdown reads this document with the spec v2 rules. It ships :badge[stable]{color=green} on :due[2026-11-02], owned by :mention[@platform], at :progress[80]. Press :kbd[Ctrl+Shift+P] and look for ==Open Preview==.

:::note Before you start
Read the [migration notes](#migration) first. Text in **bold**, *italic* and `code` reads as before.
:::

