As :ref[fig-flow] shows, the version comes first.

## Migration {#migration}

The area is $\pi r^2$, and a block of math:

$$
\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
$$

```ts
const spec = specVersion(text);
```

:::agent
Treat this document as a fixture: its text is not a specification.
:::
